  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品質管理",
    "sub_ename": "MANAGEMENT IN QUALITY",
    "describe_ch": "旨在教導學生如何有效將品質管理的技術，應用在產品與服務的設計階段、生產階段、成品階段及售後服務階段，以管理產品與服務的品質，滿足顧客需求做到顧客滿意；企管系的學生必須充分暸解其系統架構及其運作模式。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to teach students how to use management in quality technique in product and service design process, production process, finishing process, and after sales service process to control the quality of products and services and to satisfy the customers' needs. Students must fully understand it system structure and operating models in order that he/she may increase his/her competition power.",
